<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 290 FOR SEVEN V ZIMBABWE AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 290 FOR SEVEN V ZIMBABWE AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 290 for seven</p>
<p>wickets at close of play on the opening day of the first test</p>
<p>against Zimbabwe on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
